"""
autoV2_FIXED.py - AutoPoster Pro (Chrome Profile Generator / MavelyLink / AutoPoster)

Repaired from the PyLingual decompilation of the original autoV2.py
(Python 3.12 bytecode) so that it runs on Windows 10 / Python 3.7.7.

  * Standalone :  python autoV2_FIXED.py
  * Diagnostic :  python autoV2_FIXED.py --diagnose
  * TAB module :  TAB_META, build(parent, ctx), on_show(), on_hide(), teardown()

Local licensing (serial / HWID / activation / licence cache / LicenseWindow)
has been removed on purpose: the host application handles licensing.

Runtime requirements:
  - Playwright :  pip install playwright          (Python 3.7 -> playwright<=1.35)
                  python -m playwright install chromium
  - openpyxl   :  pip install openpyxl            (Excel .xlsx publications)
  - Pillow     :  pip install pillow              (optional: logo, coloured
                  backgrounds, watermark, collage of scraped images)
  - tkinterdnd2:  optional (drag & drop of CSV/XLSX files)
  - psutil     :  optional (faster watchdog process lookup)
"""
